@host = devhub.test
@token = Bearer YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN

### Get Recommended Users (Basic)
GET https://{{host}}/api/v1/users/recommended
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get Recommended Users with Limit
GET https://{{host}}/api/v1/users/recommended?limit=5
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get Recommended Users - Force Refresh Cache
GET https://{{host}}/api/v1/users/recommended?limit=10&force_refresh=true
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get Recommended Users - Large Batch
GET https://{{host}}/api/v1/users/recommended?limit=20
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get Recommended Users - Single Recommendation
GET https://{{host}}/api/v1/users/recommended?limit=1
Authorization: {{token}}

